{"urn": "lycophron-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "nauck-tgf-ocr", "locus": "nauck_tgf_1889_0849.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΑΣΤΡΑΓΑΛΙΣΤΑΙ"}
{"urn": "lycophron-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "nauck-tgf-ocr", "locus": "nauck_tgf_1889_0849.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "damantis filium), ὃν οἱ μὲν (ὃν μὲν T) Κλεισώνυμον, οἱ δὲ Αἰανὴ"}
