{"urn": "lycophron-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "nauck-tgf-ocr", "locus": "nauck_tgf_1889_0849.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ath. X p. 420 B: μαρτυρεῖ δὲ καὶ περὶ τούτων (de Menedemi"}
